WEBVTT

00:08:27.987 --> 00:08:30.176
But that is about to change.

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:31.405
It has to.

00:08:35.537 --> 00:08:37.108
TMD: So let me tell you a story.

00:08:37.890 --> 00:08:39.501
About three weeks ago --

00:08:40.282 --> 00:08:41.828
many of you may have watched --

00:08:41.852 --> 00:08:45.022
Vanessa and I and a team
of 10 women walked 100 miles

00:08:45.046 --> 00:08:47.077
on the actual Underground Railroad.

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:49.126
We did it in five days --

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:51.580
five long and beautiful days.

00:08:51.604 --> 00:08:53.447
And the world watched.

00:08:53.821 --> 00:08:56.154
Three million people
watched the live stream.

00:08:56.178 --> 00:08:59.265
Some of you in here,
the influencers, shared the story.

00:08:59.289 --> 00:09:01.716
Urban Radio blasted it across the country.